{"id":"8aee8d29de8710d2","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-proof-closed.md","title":"Proof Closed","display":"df-proof-closed — Proof Closed","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-proof-closed","aliases":["72-df-proof-closed"],"display":"df-proof-closed — Proof Closed","depends_on":["[[72-df-natural-deduction]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.4.8 print47–48/PDF59–60","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-proof-closed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-proof-closed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-closed — Proof Closed"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c916f34e9cc3391\" href=\"?note=4c916f34e9cc3391\" title=\"72-df-natural-deduction\">72-df-natural-deduction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.4.8 print47–48/PDF59–60"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal N}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal N}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\\in\\{\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma,\\mathbf{NK}_\\Sigma\\}\">\\(\\mathcal N\\in\\{\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma,\\mathbf{NK}_\\Sigma\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OpenAsm}\">\\(\\operatorname{OpenAsm}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c916f34e9cc3391\" href=\"?note=4c916f34e9cc3391\" title=\"72-df-natural-deduction\">72-df-natural-deduction</a> 的实际根假设函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClosedProof}(\\pi):\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{OpenAsm}(\\pi)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ClosedProof}(\\pi):\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{OpenAsm}(\\pi)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>ClosedProof用于带解除机制的自然演绎对象。它不要求根公式无自由对象变量，也不把任意相继式证明伪装成有OpenAsm的对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-natural-deduction","status":"resolved","id":"4c916f34e9cc3391","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-natural-deduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-natural-deduction","status":"resolved","id":"4c916f34e9cc3391","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal N}$，$\\mathcal N\\in\\{\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma,\\mathbf{NK}_\\Sigma\\}$；$\\operatorname{OpenAsm}$ 是 [[72-df-natural-deduction]] 的实际根假设函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N\\in\\{\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma,\\mathbf{NK}_\\Sigma\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OpenAsm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ClosedProof}(\\pi):\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{OpenAsm}(\\pi)=\\varnothing.","display":true}],"bytes":1000,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-closed|df-proof-closed — Proof Closed]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-proof-closed|df-proof-closed — Proof Closed]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-proof-closed|72-df-proof-closed]]"}],"outgoing":["4c916f34e9cc3391"]}